# Command Utils


## User Group
* Add an User Group 'sudo groupadd <group_name>'
* Delete an User Group 'sudo groupdel <group_name>'
* Add group to the current user 'sudo usermod -aG <group_name> $USER'
* Remove user from an user group 'sudo gpasswd -d $USER <group_name>'

## Service
* Start a service 'sudo systemctl start <service_name>'
* Stop a service 'sudo systemctl stop <service_name>'
